project_details:
Primary Duties:

Conduct outreach to landowners and partners and advise/recommend/support  restoration and/or habitat management and improvement projects;  
Write conservation implementation plans including mapping, site assessments, and project details; 
Establish, improve, and maintain grassland habitats and riparian zones; 
Collect monitoring data for grassland and stream restoration projects;
Implement low-tech, process-based stream restoration practices on cooperating private land as well as public lands that includes but is not limited to siting and laying out in-stream structures, and supervising the construction of in-stream structures; 
Present papers, findings, research, and habitat conservation outcomes to peers, general public, and conservation groups;  
Operate appropriate heavy equipment (work truck, trailer, UTV, etc. Knowledge of grassland and/or riparian ecology and research issues
